==Battleground==
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
*3 [[Maawth]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 80~83.33 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Dober]] spawns as the boss after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*4 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*2 [[Techn-Old Hyena]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
*8 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The combination of Elizabeth and Dark Dober creates good synergy where Dark Dober weakens your cats while Elizabeth protects Dark Dober with high damage waves and bulk. Additional Techn-Old Hyenas and Maawths also appear to punish pushing into their ranges and supplement the duo's power.

It is recommended to bring [[Awakened Bahamut Cat|Awakened Bahamut]] to try and burst significant damage to the first Elizabeth before the second arrives, and then for general burst once off cooldown. A Wave Shield like [[Octopus Cat|Octopus]] is also recommended to avoid losing damage output to Dark Dober, as well as [[Jetpack Cat (Rare Cat)|Jetpack]] to stall given the stage comprises primarily of Aliens / Dark. Lastly, several Mythic cats such as [[Master of Life Dr. Nova (Special Cat)|Master of Life Dr. Nova]], [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Newtone]] and [[Master of Selection Darvin (Special Cat)|Master of Selection Darvin]] will comprise your main sustained damage and support sources for the stage.

==Trivia==
*A Vast Red Waste name refers to the vast wastes of the Australian [[wikipedia:Outback|Outback]] and its red soils, as [[New Horizon]] has an Australian theme.

